            {
                "comment": "Had basically three assignments each week, but as long as you paid attention in lecture they were pretty simple. Super interesting course, was really fun to be able to see all sorts of exhibits around campus and think deeper about them. Campbell is super kind and willing to give feedback/assistance if you ask. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "Amazing professor. She's caring and willing to work with you on extensions and feedback. She offered a ton of extra credit. Heavy online discussion post based which you make based on lecture and reading material, but pretty easy. Her projects seem hard but she is a very fair grader and as long as you try a little you can pass the class with an A.",
